    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Creations of Bile",
    "summary": "As the battle begins, give **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY** models of yours (not **DAMNED** models) augmentations that last until the battle ends: pick any one of them, or roll two D6 to get two at random. With **FABIUS BILE** as your **WARLORD**, you may re-roll either or both of those dice. Getting the same augmentation twice adds nothing.\n\nThe augmentations, by D6 result:\n\n- **1 - Cholinergic Accelerants**: the model's melee weapons get +1 Attacks.\n- **2 - Hyperadrenal Infusion**: the model gets +2\" Move.\n- **3 - Paraneural Reactions**: the model's melee weapons improve their [Weapon Skill](vsdata:core-rule/weapons) by 1.\n- **4 - Supracutaneous Chitination**: the model's Toughness improves by 1.\n- **5 - Macrotensile Sinews**: the model's melee weapons get +1 Strength.\n- **6 - Ophthalmic Enhancement**: the model's ranged weapons improve their [Ballistic Skill](vsdata:core-rule/weapons) by 1.",
